Subject: [PATCH 1/4] test(retrieval-server): build the PDF test fixtures
 without reportlab

tests/pdf_fixtures.py drew its text PDFs with reportlab's canvas and its
scanned ones with reportlab's ImageReader. reportlab is installed only for
the xhtml2pdf renderer, which plan 5.2 removes, so the fixtures now use what
the image keeps: pypdfium2's page-object API draws the same lines in the
standard Helvetica font, and Pillow's PDF writer makes the image-only pages.
The password-protected fixture still uses pypdf (requirements-dev.txt).

